"text":"幼い頃は仲が良かったのだが、最近は疎遠になっていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公たちが３年ぶりに故郷に戻ってきたことで、再会することになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"凜とした美貌が人目を惹くが、目つきが悪い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"視力が悪くつい目を細める癖があり、性格がキツイわけではない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"メガネもコンタクトも好きではないらしく、いまだに裸眼で頑張っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5213","sourceWorkId":"21092","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“グループ” の一員。 凛とした美貌が人目を惹く少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃は仲が良かったのだが、最近は疎遠になっていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"視力が悪く目を細める癖があるため、目つきが悪いと見られがち。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため話しかけ辛い印象を受けるが、性格がキツイというわけではない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"メガネもコンタクトも好きではないらしく、いまだに裸眼で頑張っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"部活で剣道を続けていて、結構な腕前。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"正義感が強い。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"27218"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"学年","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"27218","value":"2年生"},{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"2 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5213","sourceWorkId":"21092","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5213","sourceWorkId":"21092","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"158 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5213","sourceWorkId":"21092","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"85 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5213","sourceWorkId":"21092","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"59 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5213","sourceWorkId":"21092","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/01/01102d143041096e83b041a7d9b0d43ac7b5af884ca229b5b932f09d7eb2f63e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/21/21f1059f72c41e9ccae01ca5146918b8812aed9843c9c35d4f711ffd22163292.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤原由林","creatorId":"vndb:s992","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s992","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s992","name":"藤原 由林","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:113637:27218:25037:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c23428","characterName":"あーや","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"27219","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"113637"}],"egsCharacterIds":["5214"],"vndbCharacterId":"c23428"},"originalCharacterName":"あーや","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"88"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"90"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"61"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of the childhood gang's members. She is one year older than the others, and the very gentle, big sister-like girl. Openminded and a bit of an airhead, a steady and unpretentious girl. The protagonist's childhood friend, he considers her the same as his own sister and has always admired her. Works as a maid at Shouko's house. She keeps the reason why she works as a maid a secret."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c23428"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"一つ年上でおっとり屋さん。良く言えばおおらかだが、少し抜けたところもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"優しい性格のために、グループ内では本当のお姉さんのように慕われていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とは家が近く、主人公は「年上の綺麗なお姉さん」という憧れを抱いていた。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5214","sourceWorkId":"21092","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“グループ” の一員。 一つ年上の優しいお姉さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"良く言えばおおらかだが、少し抜けたところもある おっとり屋さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とは幼なじみで、本当のお姉さんのように慕われていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在は摩庭祥子の家で、何故かメイドとして働いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お金のためということでもないようだが、詳細は不明。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スタイルが良く、メイドの衣装が少々キワドイため、主人公としては目のやり場に困ってしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"27219"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"学年","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"27219","value":"3年生"},{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"3 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5214","sourceWorkId":"21092","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5214","sourceWorkId":"21092","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"160 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5214","sourceWorkId":"21092","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5214","sourceWorkId":"21092","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"61 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5214","sourceWorkId":"21092","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/aa/aa77ef54e5d3488be1cec4daa1707ee208ddde4f83ede756fa0a15ffd4553b4d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c0/c023f5eda27c77fd4b937d826638f568a0186c32bafc1c007724a7379dd08176.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"羽月理恵","creatorId":"vndb:s928","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s928","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s928","name":"羽月 理恵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:113637:27219:5907:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c23429","characterName":"みぅーちゃん","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"27220","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"113637"}],"egsCharacterIds":["5215"],"vndbCharacterId":"c23429"},"originalCharacterName":"みぅーちゃん","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"84"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"156"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist's younger twin sister. Because they are the same age, she usually calls her brother by his name, but when she wants to act spoiled, she calls him onii-chan. She cannot take care of her own life, and is always acting spoiled in front of her brother. Her attitude towards him is pretty straightforward: because he is her only blood-related relative, she regards her brother as the most important person in the world. Her feelings towards her brother extend the realm of normal siblings' relationship. While she is very popular with the boys, she has not the slightest bit of interest in them. She also resents the other girls, especially the ones of the childhood gang."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c23429"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の双子の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"歳は同じということで、普段は名前で呼んでくるが、甘えたいときなどは“お兄ちゃん”と呼びかけてくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして、生活能力がないために、普段から兄には甘えっぱなしだった。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5215","sourceWorkId":"21092","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の双子の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"年は同じで普段は名前で呼ばれるが、甘えたい時などは “お兄ちゃん” と呼び掛けてくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生活能力が無く、普段から兄に甘えっぱなしで、兄に対しては良くも悪くも開けっ広げ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"たった二人の身内ということもあり、兄を何よりも大切にしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“いつまでも二人っきりでいられれば良いのに……” という、兄妹を越えた想いを抱いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ルックスは抜群なのでモテるが、男子にはまったく興味がない様子。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"27220"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"学年","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"27220","value":"2年生"},{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"2 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5215","sourceWorkId":"21092","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"84 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5215","sourceWorkId":"21092","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"156 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5215","sourceWorkId":"21092","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"85 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5215","sourceWorkId":"21092","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"57 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5215","sourceWorkId":"21092","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a728908d74b5e0095b0151059d50881dfaf43ce5ccc6d92abde071ad7b19a0fe.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2c/2cbcd6c943d38d8c891bc72e5d725372c166d612a8f432ba53cb5caf214a9024.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"春日アン","creatorId":"vndb:s638","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s638","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s638","name":"春日アン(春乃うらら)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:113637:27220:6480:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c23430","characterName":"摩庭 祥子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"27221","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"113637"}],"egsCharacterIds":["5216"],"vndbCharacterId":"c23430"},"originalCharacterName":"摩庭 祥子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"81"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"152"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"80"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of the childhood gang's members, a taciturn and elusive girl. Shouko is often mistaken to be a doll whenever she is silent. Often bullied during childhood, however, Shouko doesn't show any signs of misery. She is a member of the breeding club, which takes care of the animals at the school. Her favorite animal is rabbit, and she is always carrying around a stuffed rabbit. Doesn't like men, and claims to hate all men."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c23430"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"掴み所のない性格で、そのせいか、幼い頃は周囲からよくいじめを受けていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だがそれものれんに腕押しといった態度で、あまり苦にする様子は見せなかったのだった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"作り物めいた美少女で、黙っていると本当に人形のようにも見える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"（そして実際、黙っていることも多い）"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5216","sourceWorkId":"21092","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“グループ” の一員。 寡黙で掴み所のない少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"作り物めいた美少女で、黙っていると本当の人形のようにも見える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃に周囲からいじめを受けていたが、あまり苦にする様子は見せなかった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園では飼育部に所属し、動物の世話をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特にウサギが好きで、よくウサギのぬいぐるみを抱えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"病気の母親がおり、何よりも大切に思っている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"27221"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"学年","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"27221","value":"2年生"},{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"2 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5216","sourceWorkId":"21092","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"81 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5216","sourceWorkId":"21092","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"152 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5216","sourceWorkId":"21092","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"80 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5216","sourceWorkId":"21092","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"55 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5216","sourceWorkId":"21092","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/71/71b54ecce7f6a48e408d11523ff3ed79472d03add34b650e6f1c4086419fc7bb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/41/41fcbc1bc19eaf02474ede701355735e3b784b22184e1acc909d80a55ca07d01.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"間宮菜南子","creatorId":"vndb:s999","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s999","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s999","name":"間宮 菜南子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:113637:27221:15995:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c47182","characterName":"りぉーちゃん","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"27222","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"113637"}],"egsCharacterIds":["5212"],"vndbCharacterId":"c47182"},"originalCharacterName":"りぉーちゃん","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃、ある事件で両親を失っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その事件のせいで諒人も負傷し、それをきっかけに不思議な能力が発現してしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それは、人の感情が“色”で見えるというもの。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"喜びはコハク。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"悲しみはサファイア。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"怒りはルビー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして好意はエメラルド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"諒人には、まるで宝石のような輝きの色で、人の感情が視えてしまうのだった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それさえ除けばごく普通の好青年。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"双子の妹がいる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5212","sourceWorkId":"21092","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。 ごく普通の好青年。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃の事件で両親を失っており、その際に諒人も負傷してしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして昏睡から目覚めると、人の感情が “色” で視えるようになってしまっていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"感情の色は宝石のように輝き、喜びは琥珀。 悲しみはサファイア。 怒りはルビー。 好意はエメラルドに視える。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"27222"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"学年","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"27222","value":"2年生"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/56/569f7706b141af4e222ff12adb5351855dcfb568af8c56a0072b2a9ca1b1c56c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/89/89baf2654852c98fee02f67870883ef660e69ec409e06e28b93ff509f01d1474.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"egs:brand:945","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:945","canonicalEntityId":"egs:brand:945","name":"MOONSTONE","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:21092:945","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p15756","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p15756","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p15756","name":"SVN","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:126793:v16069","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p251","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p251","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p251","name":"MOONSTONE","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:155531:v16069","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p251","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p251","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p251","name":"MOONSTONE","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:42219:v16069","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p25